WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,560
After it's done, except for the land, the Ghost Hotel, and anything else you care about.

2
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:08,520
The red banquet is not enough

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,420
These are not enough

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,820
Mr. Su, don’t have a big appetite.

5
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,920
I'm not the one asking for help

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,120
I will leave after participating in the game

7
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,520
The benefits brought by those lands and industries

8
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,640
Not as much as my own money

9
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:25,380
What's the use if I ask for it?

10
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:28,540
then what do you want

11
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,740
Yes I want you

12
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,170
Sign a contract with me

13
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,850
become mine

14
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,170
Jade ghost slave

15
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:39,280
I won’t agree unless it’s personal

16
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,360
It’s just that I’m now at the peak of the Eighth Level

17
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:43,080
Just go to Liquor Street

18
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:46,120
It’s rare to find high-level contracts that can be applied directly to your body.

19
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,530
What a coincidence

20
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:48,930
I happen to have one
